comment on table public.navigation_menus is 'The site header and footer menus, one row per menu. No row means the menu in src/lib/config/navigation.ts renders instead, so an empty table is the shipped navigation and deleting a row is how a menu is reset. Publicly readable because it is the navigation on every public page; admin-only to write, because these links go into everybody''s markup.';
